## 5. Runtime Execution Order (per bar / per confirmed close)

1. MTF Structure Adapter
2. Liquidity Hierarchy Engine
3. Premium/Discount Array Engine
4. Fair Value Gap Engine
5. Order Block Engine
6. Market Structure Shift Engine
7. Breaker Block Engine
8. Institutional POI Aggregator
9. Confidence Scoring Engine
10. Trade Rating Engine
11. Institutional Event Log
12. Institutional Audit *(can run less frequently — e.g. once per N bars — since it is a consistency check, not a live decision input)*
13. Statistics Engine *(runs on closed-trade/session boundaries, not every bar)*

Fail-closed rule applies at every step: if step *n* receives `integrity = false` from any required input, step *n* emits `integrity = false` and performs no further computation; steps 8–13 downstream of it do the same.

