## 6. Module Interface Definitions

Each module exposes exactly one public compute function and one contract type, per Phase 8 convention.

| Module | Function signature (conceptual) | Returns |
|---|---|---|
| MTF Structure Adapter | `computeMTFStructure(timeframes[]) → MTFStructureContract[]` | array, one per timeframe |
| Liquidity Hierarchy Engine | `rankLiquidity(selectionData, structureData, mtfData) → LiquidityHierarchyContract[]` | ranked pools |
| Premium/Discount Array Engine | `computePDArray(structureData, mtfData) → PDArrayContract` | single current zone state |
| FVG Engine | `detectFVGs(contextSnapshot) → FVGContract[]` | active + historical FVGs |
| Order Block Engine | `detectOrderBlocks(structureData, sweepData, contextSnapshot) → OrderBlockContract[]` | active + mitigated OBs |
| MSS Engine | `detectMSS(structureData, mtfData) → MSSContract[]` | MSS events |
| Breaker Block Engine | `reclassifyBreakers(orderBlocks, mssEvents) → BreakerBlockContract[]` | breaker blocks |
| POI Aggregator | `aggregatePOIs(fvgs, obs, breakers, pdArray, liquidity) → POIRegistryContract[]` | unified POI registry (append) |
| Confidence Scoring Engine | `scoreConfidence(poiRegistry, arbitrationResult, recommendation, validationSummary, mssEvents) → ConfidenceScoreContract[]` | scores |
| Trade Rating Engine | `rateTrade(confidenceScores, recommendation, arbitrationResult) → TradeRatingContract[]` | grades |
| Institutional Event Log | `logEvent(sourceModule, eventType, payloadRef) → InstitutionalEventLogContract` | append-only entry |
| Institutional Audit | `auditConsistency(poiRegistry, scores, ratings, eventLog) → InstitutionalAuditContract[]` | audit results |
| Statistics Engine | `computeStatistics(ratings, eventLog) → StatisticsContract[]` | aggregated stats |

