## 8. Freeze Governance Assignment (Phase 9)

Per the existing three-tier model:

| Tier | Modules | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Tier 1 (permanently frozen once validated) | MTF Structure Adapter, FVG Engine, Order Block Engine, MSS Engine, Breaker Block Engine, POI Aggregator | Structural detection logic — must match ICT definitions exactly; changing detection criteria invalidates all downstream scoring history. |
| Tier 2 (reopenable under defined criteria) | Confidence Scoring Engine (weights), Trade Rating Engine (grade thresholds), Liquidity Hierarchy Engine (tier boundaries), PD Array Engine (equilibrium method) | Parameters may be recalibrated as statistics accumulate, without changing detection logic. |
| Tier 3 (freely evolving) | Statistics Engine (dimensions/reports), Institutional Audit (checks performed) | Purely observational — safe to extend without risk to live decision logic. |

